  "Question": "\\(n\\) is a normal vector to a plane. Which of the following is also a normal vector to this plane?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(-2n\\)",
    "B": "The zero vector",
    "C": "A direction vector of a nonzero line lying in the plane",
    "D": "A nonzero vector perpendicular to \\(n\\)"
