  "Correct Answer": "A",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "A nonzero multiple of a normal vector is still perpendicular to the plane. A direction vector in the plane is parallel to the plane and is not a normal vector.",
